# Build symlinks created by `nix build` / `nixos-rebuild build`. These point
# into /nix/store and change on every build, so tracking them means the tree
# is permanently dirty and every nix command prints "Git tree is dirty".
result
result-*

# Scratch clones / checkouts of other projects that sometimes get made inside
# this repo. Not part of the config; ignored so they stop showing up as
# untracked noise in `git status`.
/ng-check/
